{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\nD24榴槤/芝士奶蓋牛奶口味\n</p>\n<h2>甜悅新推出山竹雪條系列刨冰！</h2>\n<p>人氣甜品店「甜悅 Joyful Dessert Lab」近期推出超吸睛嘅「泰國山竹雪條」系列刨冰！將可愛爆燈嘅泰國山竹造型雪條原支放喺綿綿冰上面，打卡感十足。提供芝士奶蓋牛奶綿綿冰口味及D24 榴槤珠珠口味，前者綿密牛奶刨冰上面鋪滿厚厚一層鹹香濃郁嘅芝士奶蓋，加埋酸甜清新嘅山竹造型雪條，味道平衡得啱啱好；D24 榴槤冰濃郁綿密，仲有山竹嘅清甜味，榴槤迷一家要試！</p>\n<p>甜悅<br/>\n官方IG：@joyful_dessertlab_hk</p>\n<p>【知道香港人超級忙，忙到無時間諗食乜玩乜買乜，「新假期吃喝玩樂」 幫你每日精選玩樂、食買靈感，一網打盡全港食買玩熱點！想分享你嘅最愛地點？DM 我哋，一齊帶出港人生活新態度！】</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179558641753144997_7038022576b0679723fec9.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179558641753144997_7038022576b0679723fec9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179558641967065726_16551271116b06797433f78.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179558641967065726_16551271116b06797433f78.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17955864217006822_2341489216b0679760d51f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17955864217006822_2341489216b0679760d51f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DgJkaj8k0pU/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T06:23:55.435882+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":426,"images":3,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T06:00:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T06:57:21.597525+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T06:17:20.536963+00:00","content_hash":"98e7f53e9f09d24bff66fc32fd28509a9328859a8c6c069dbdccb15533fa6d65","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}